{"id":"grenouille","lemma":"grenouille","pos":"noun","rank":3877,"glosses":["frog"],"ipa":"/ɡʁə.nuj/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f4/Fr-grenouille.ogg/Fr-grenouille.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"grenouilles"},"formAudio":{"grenouilles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Le_Commissaire-grenouilles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Qui a mis une grenouille dans mon lit ?","en":"Who put a frog in my bed?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"bed"}]},{"text":"Il paraît qu'il mange des grenouilles.","en":"I hear that he eats frogs.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to appear","l":"paraître"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to eat","l":"manger"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Une grenouille sortit de l'eau.","en":"A frog came out of the water.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to exit","l":"sortir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"water"}]},{"text":"Les grenouilles ont peur des serpents.","en":"Frogs are afraid of snakes.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"snake","l":"serpent"}]},{"text":"Quand j'étais petit, j'avais peur des grenouilles.","en":"When I was a kid, I was afraid of frogs.","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"small, little"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]}]}